abstract: >
  NEXARIUM is an open decentralized web infrastructure
  and interoperable ecosystem focused on semantic systems,
  decentralized identity, institutional transparency,
  federated communication, machine-readable architecture,
  and long-term digital continuity across Web2 and Web3 environments.

